{"prefix": "---- MODULE imo_1982_p1 ----\nEXTENDS TLAPS, Integers\n\n\nTHEOREM imo_1982_p1 ==\n    \\A f \\in [Nat -> Nat] :\n        (\\A m, n \\in Nat \\ {0} : (f[m + n] - f[m] - f[n] = 0) \\/ (f[m + n] - f[m] - f[n] = 1)) /\\\n        (f[2] = 0) /\\ (f[3] > 0) /\\ (f[9999] = 3333)\n        => (f[1982] = 660)", "fragment": "BY SetExtensionality", "suffix": "\n====\n", "theorem_name": "imo_1982_p1"}